# BitNode Console direnv configuration
#
# This file is evaluated by direnv when entering/leaving the repository.
# It loads the Nix development shell, watches key project files so env changes
# reload automatically, and optionally applies local machine-specific overrides.
#
# Learn more:
# - direnv: https://direnv.net/
# - nix-direnv: https://github.com/nix-community/nix-direnv
# - VS Code direnv extension (required):
#   https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=mkhl.direnv

# Load the repository development environment from shell.nix.
use nix

# Reload direnv environment when core project/build config files change.
watch_file Cargo.toml
watch_file Makefile.toml
watch_file book.toml
watch_file shell.nix

# Optional local overrides (not committed) for developer-specific settings.
source_env_if_exists .envrc.local